<title>USA: XCL Ltd says closes two private placements.</title>
<headline>XCL Ltd says closes two private placements.</headline>
<dateline>LAFAYETTE, La. 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>XCL Ltd said Tuesday it closed two private placements worth a total of $100 million.</p>
<p>It said the first placement consisted of $75 million of 13.5 percent senior secured notes due 2004 with common stock purchase warrants.</p>
<p>The second consisted of $25 million of $8.08 cumulative convertible preferred stock, also with common stock purchase warrants, the company said.</p>
</text>
